<title>UK: UK output prices unchanged in February.</title>
<headline>UK output prices unchanged in February.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics (ONS) released the following provisional data on UK input and output prices in February.(Prev data in brackets)</p>
<p> OUTPUT PRICES (unadj)	   FEB	 JAN   (PREL JAN)</p>
<p> Monthly change		    unch	0.2	  (0.2)</p>
<p> Yr/yr change			1.3*	1.5	  (1.5)</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		 125.0     125.0	(125.0))</p>
<p>OUTPUT PRICES EX FOOD/DRINK/TOBACCO/PETROLEUM (unadj)</p>
<p> Monthly change		    0.1	 0.3	  (0.3)</p>
<p> Yr/yr change			0.5**     0.6	  (0.6)</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		 120.3     120.2     (120.2)</p>
